{"url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/Meeting.aspx?Id=dd91dbe4-a62b-4662-800a-7bc37fd706f5&Agenda=PostMinutes&lang=English", "meeting_type": "Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee", "bills": null, "present": ["M. Brown", "M. van Holst", "B. Armstrong", "M. Salih", "J. Helmer", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "J. Morgan", "P. Hubert", "A. Hopkins", "V. Ridley", "S. Turner", "H.L. Usher", "T. Park", "J. Zaifman", "L. Rowe (Secretary)"], "also_present": [], "remote_attendance": [], "absent": [], "title": "Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee", "datetime": "2016-02-25 16:00:00", "content": [], "items": {"1": {"title": "Disclosures of\n  Pecuniary Interest", "number": "1", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "2": {"title": "CORPORATE OPERATING\n  BUDGET\n(all amounts rounded to the nearest\n  $1,000s)", "number": "2", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "3": {"title": "CORPORATE CAPITAL\n  BUDGET\n(all amounts rounded to the nearest\n  $1,000s)", "number": "3", "content": [{"string": "That the following actions be taken with\n  respect to Business Case #18 \u2013 \u201cBack to the River Project\u201d:\na)\u00a0 $700,000 BE APPROVED in 2016 to\n  complete the necessary environmental assessment; and,\nb)\u00a0 $5,000,000 BE IDENTIFIED in the\n  Economic Development Reserve Fund for completion of the Inaugural Project,\n  with the funding to be released upon finalization of the Environmental\n  Assessment, confirmation and Council approval of project costs and\n  confirmation of any external sources of financing.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["M. Brown", "M. van Holst", "M. Salih", "J. Helmer", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "J. Morgan", "P. Hubert", "A. Hopkins", "V. Ridley", "S. Turner", "H.L. Usher", "T. Park", "J. Zaifman (14)"]}, {"vote": "Nays:", "voters": ["B. Armstrong (1)"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"string": "Following actions be taken with respect to\n  Business Case #1 \u2013 Library Ten Year Capital Plan $1,900,000\n\u00a0\na)\u00a0 approve immediate flow of the 2016,\n  2017 and 2018 ask in the amount of $1,300,000 - using unallocated London\n  Hydro dividend monies - as one-time monies, not from levy; and,\nb) approve 2018 capital levy in the amount\n  of $200,000 and 2019 capital levy in the amount of $400,000.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "amendment to part b) to read as follows:\n\u00a0\n\"b) an additional $250,000 capital\n  budget allocation from levy annually from 2016-2019\"", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Motion Failed", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["M. van Holst", "B. Armstrong", "P. Hubert", "V. Ridley", "S. Turner (5)"]}, {"vote": "Nays:", "voters": ["M. Brown", "M. Salih", "J. Helmer", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "J. Morgan", "A. Hopkins", "H.L. Usher", "T. Park", "J. Zaifman (10)"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Failed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["M. Brown", "M. van Holst", "B. Armstrong", "M. Salih", "J. Helmer", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "J. Morgan", "P. Hubert", "A. H